@loyalty-discount
Feature: Loyalty tier pricing
  As a returning customer
  I want my loyalty tier reflected in the checkout total
  So that the price I see rewards my history with the brand

  # Settled: AC-1 to AC-4 (ac.md). Every value below is copied from the AC.
  # NOT settled: the Platinum tier. The business has not agreed a reduction, so there is
  # deliberately NO Platinum scenario and no expected value. Do not infer one.
  # See "Open decisions" at the end of this file.

  @happy-path @smoke
